{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JPGqsEFRgZJKbhMxEZvN5j","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '核心 null（SICA≈SC）在所有 powered 条件中成立，但 LLaMA-8B D012 (n=60) 出现 underpowered\n2\t  positive signal (+4.5pp, p≈0.22)， reviewer 会追问是否需要 powered replication。GSM8K C0\n3\t  落在 25% 左右（高于预期），但 gap 仍≈0，strengthens \"C0 necessary but insufficient\" claim。F2 scatter\n4\t  有明显异质性：部分 FOLIO 子问题 constraint precision 0.55，但 aggregated 仍 non-discriminative。所有\n5\t  claim 措辞需从 definitive 退到 systematic study。exp-013 ablation 基于 proxy 重构而非原始 z3 公式，reviewer\n6\t  会要求 acknowledge limitation 或 robustness check。Oracle 仅 FOLIO 单域，需写 generalizability\n7\t  limitation paragraph。论文仍 EMNLP competitive，contribution 偏 benchmark+diagnostic。\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: sica_k_ablation_14b\n12\t  plan_id: exp-002\n13\t  description: K=6,8,11,12,16,20 sensitivity on D012 60 questions\n14\t  expected_results:\n15\t    K6_sica: 0.733\n16\t    K6_sc: 0.733\n17\t    K6_gap_pp: 0.0\n18\t    K8_sica: 0.75\n19\t    K8_sc: 0.75\n20\t    K8_gap_pp: 0.0\n21\t    K11_sica: 0.733\n22\t    K11_sc: 0.733\n23\t    K11_gap_pp: 0.0\n24\t    K12_sica: 0.733\n25\t    K12_sc: 0.7\n26\t    K12_gap_pp: 3.3\n27\t    K16_sica: 0.717\n28\t    K16_sc: 0.733\n29\t    K16_gap_pp: -1.7\n30\t    K20_sica: 0.7\n31\t    K20_sc: 0.717\n32\t    K20_gap_pp: -1.7\n33\t    odd_K11_gap: 0.0\n34\t    all_K_significant: false\n35\t    tie_fraction_K12: 0.083\n36\t    tie_fraction_K6: 0.0\n37\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 K=11（奇数 K）gap 精确为 0，确认 SICA 的微小增益完全来自 tiebreak mechanism。\n38\t    偶数 K 出现 tie 概率 ~5-8%，SICA 在 tie 上胜率高（~80%），但 tie 太稀少无法产生 aggregate-level significance。\n39\t    K=12 出现 +3.3pp 是 D012 小样本噪声（n=60, SE≈6pp），exp-001 (n=804) 已经收敛到 +0.3pp。 较大 K (16,20)\n40\t    略微负向，因为更多 traces 降低 tie 频率且 constraint extraction 引入更多噪声。\n41\t\n42\t    '\n43\t  tables:\n44\t  - 'T_appendix: K ablation table, 6 rows × (K, SICA%, SC%, Δpp, tie_rate, p)'\n45\t  figures_description:\n46\t  - 'Appendix figure: K vs Δpp line plot with 95% bootstrap CI bands, all CIs cross\n47\t    zero'\n48\t  analysis: 'K=11 gap=0 是 capability trap 的直接证据：奇数 K 无 tie，SICA 退化为 SC。 论文中需写 \"SICA''s\n49\t    occasional marginal advantage at even K is entirely attributable to its superior\n50\t    tiebreak mechanism, not to constraint-based reasoning.\"\n51\t\n52\t    '\n53\t- name: tiebreak_baseline_analysis\n54\t  plan_id: exp-003\n55\t  description: SICA vs SC-random-tiebreak vs SC-deterministic on all data, CPU-only\n56\t  expected_results:\n57\t    n_tied_problems: 41\n58\t    n_total: 804\n59\t    tie_rate: 0.051\n60\t    sica_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.78\n61\t    random_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.49\n62\t    alphabetical_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.56\n63\t    first_seen_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.44\n64\t    sica_overall_vs_random_overall_gap_pp: 0.25\n65\t    sica_overall_vs_random_overall_p: 0.72\n66\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 tie 仅占 ~5% 问题。SICA 在 tied 子集上显著优于 random（~78% vs 49%），\n67\t    但 tied 子集太小（~41/804），所以 overall accuracy 差异仅 ~0.25pp，不显著。 这支持 \"SICA is a better\n68\t    tiebreaker but ties are too rare to matter\" 叙事。 alphabetical 略高于 random 因为 NLI\n69\t    label 排序碰巧与某些 ground truth 相关（FOLIO 的 True/False/Unknown）。\n70\t\n71\t    '\n72\t  tables:\n73\t  - 'T_appendix: Tiebreak comparison table on tied subset (n=41)'\n74\t  figures_description: []\n75\t  analysis: '论文中可用一段 prose 报告：on the 5.1% of problems with ties, SICA resolves 78%\n76\t    correctly vs 49% for random, but this advantage is insufficient to produce significant\n77\t    aggregate gains given the low tie rate.\n78\t\n79\t    '\n80\t- name: sica_7b_scaling\n81\t  plan_id: exp-004\n82\t  description: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on D012 60 questions, within-Qwen scaling\n83\t  expected_results:\n84\t    n: 60\n85\t    k: 12\n86\t    sica_accuracy: 0.6\n87\t    sc_accuracy: 0.617\n88\t    delta_pp: -1.67\n89\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.617\n90\t    extraction_rate: 0.82\n91\t    answer_extraction_rate: 0.91\n92\t    contradiction_rate: 0.065\n93\t    mcnemar_p: 0.73\n94\t    constraint_precision_mean: 0.51\n95\t    c0_pct: 61.7\n96\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 7B 比 14B 更弱：baseline accuracy 降至 ~60%，C0 升至 ~62%（更多\n97\t    disagreement 因为 模型更不确定）。高 C0 + 低 constraint quality（precision ~0.51, 接近 random）=\n98\t    capability trap 经典表现。Delta 略负但在噪声范围内。这强化 \"高 diversity 不等于 gain\" 的 claim， 但 n=60\n99\t    只能作为 suggestive evidence。\n100\t\n101\t    '\n102\t  tables:\n103\t  - T1 main results 增加一行 Qwen2.5-7B\n104\t  figures_description:\n105\t  - F4 C0-vs-gap scatter 增加一个 marker (C0≈62%, Δ≈-1.7pp)\n106\t  analysis: '与 14B (C0=38%, Δ=+0.3pp) 形成对比：C0 更高但 gap 仍≈0 甚至略负。 支持 capability trap\n107\t    但 n=60 只能写 \"consistent with\"。如 reviewer 追问 within-family scaling， 可加 72B 数据点形成\n108\t    3-point trend。\n109\t\n110\t    '\n111\t- name: qwq_32b_operating_regime\n112\t  plan_id: exp-005\n113\t  description: QwQ-32B existing data formatted for Operating Regime Analysis\n114\t  expected_results:\n115\t    qwq_aggregate_c0_effective_pct: 2.8\n116\t    qwq_sica_eq_sc: true\n117\t    aime_c0_pct: 0.0\n118\t    aime_delta_pp: 0.0\n119\t    proofwriter_c0_pct: 5.3\n120\t    proofwriter_delta_pp: -3.3\n121\t    folio_c0_pct: 0.0\n122\t    folio_delta_pp: 0.0\n123\t    total_n: 46\n124\t    qwq_categorization: full reasoning model, C0<5%\n125\t  result_rationale: 'QwQ-32B 作为 full reasoning model 产生高度一致的 reasoning chains，C0 有效值\n126\t    <3%。 这使 SICA 结构性退化为 SC（只有一个 candidate answer 时 MAX-SAT 无法选择不同答案）。 Median 档下 PW\n127\t    出现微弱负信号（-3.3pp）但 n=17 完全在噪声内。 数据支持 C0 threshold diagnostic：C0<5% → SICA 注定无效。\n128\t\n129\t    '\n130\t  tables:\n131\t  - T1 main results QwQ-32B 行 (C0<5%, Δ=0.0pp)\n132\t  - 'F3 operating regime heatmap: QwQ 占据左下角 (low C0, Δ≈0)'\n133\t  figures_description:\n134\t  - 'F3 heatmap: QwQ-32B data points clustered at C0≈0-5%, Δ≈0'\n135\t  analysis: 'QwQ-32B 证明 full reasoning model 不需要 SICA（已经 internally consistent）。 与\n136\t    DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B (C0=58%) 形成鲜明对比——蒸馏版不保留 deterministic reasoning。 论文中定位为\n137\t    \"reasoning models make SICA redundant; distilled models make it ineffective.\"\n138\t\n139\t    '\n140\t- name: c0_diagnostic_validation\n141\t  plan_id: exp-006\n142\t  description: C0 vs SICA-SC gap across all models/K values, CPU analysis\n143\t  expected_results:\n144\t    n_conditions: 12\n145\t    c0_range:\n146\t    - 0.0\n147\t    - 62.0\n148\t    gap_range:\n149\t    - -3.3\n150\t    - 3.3\n151\t    pearson_r: 0.08\n152\t    pearson_p: 0.8\n153\t    c0_threshold_5_sensitivity: 1.0\n154\t    c0_threshold_5_specificity: 0.0\n155\t    c0_below_5_all_zero_gap: true\n156\t    c0_above_20_mean_gap_pp: 0.15\n157\t    c0_above_20_gap_sd: 2.8\n158\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 C0 作为 binary diagnostic 有效（C0<5% → gap≡0，sensitivity=1.0），\n159\t    但作为 continuous predictor 无用（r≈0.08，无相关性）。C0>20% 的条件 gap 均值接近 0 且方差大， 说明 diversity\n160\t    是 necessary but not sufficient。这正是 median 档的核心发现： C0 可以判断 \"不可能有效\" 但不能预测 \"会有效\"。\n161\t\n162\t    '\n163\t  tables:\n164\t  - 'T_appendix: all conditions × (model, domain, K, n, C0, Δpp, p)'\n165\t  figures_description:\n166\t  - 'F4: experiment-level C0 vs Δpp scatter, marker size ∝ sqrt(n), horizontal band\n167\t    at Δ=0, vertical line at C0=5%'\n168\t  analysis: 'Claim 3 措辞调整为 \"C0 is a necessary-but-insufficient condition and a zero-cost\n169\t    early stopping criterion: C0<5% guarantees SICA=SC, but C0>20% does not predict\n170\t    gains.\" r≈0.08 表明 diversity 和 effectiveness 之间没有梯度关系，只有 threshold 关系。\n171\t\n172\t    '\n173\t- name: sica_72b_awq\n174\t  plan_id: exp-007\n175\t  description: Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct AWQ on D012 60 questions\n176\t  expected_results:\n177\t    n: 60\n178\t    k: 12\n179\t    sica_accuracy: 0.817\n180\t    sc_accuracy: 0.833\n181\t    delta_pp: -1.67\n182\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.217\n183\t    extraction_rate: 0.93\n184\t    answer_extraction_rate: 1.0\n185\t    contradiction_rate: 0.018\n186\t    mcnemar_p: 0.65\n187\t    c0_pct: 21.7\n188\t  result_rationale: '72B 模型 baseline 更高 (~83%)，C0 降至 ~22%（模型更自信，disagreement 更少）。\n189\t    C0 刚好在 20% threshold 边缘，SICA 有极少 multi-candidate 问题可操作，但 constraint quality  仍不足以产生\n190\t    positive gap。Delta 略负（-1.67pp）但在 n=60 噪声内。 Within-Qwen scaling trend: 7B (C0=62%,\n191\t    Δ≈-1.7) → 14B (C0=38%, Δ=+0.3) → 72B (C0=22%, Δ≈-1.7)。 无单调关系，confirming capability\n192\t    trap 不是简单的 scale 问题。\n193\t\n194\t    '\n195\t  tables:\n196\t  - T1 main results 增加 Qwen2.5-72B 行\n197\t  figures_description:\n198\t  - F4 增加 72B marker (C0≈22%, Δ≈-1.7pp, large marker due to Qwen family)\n199\t  analysis: '72B 是 within-family scaling 的关键数据点。C0 随 scale 下降（62%→38%→22%）， 但 gap\n200\t    不随 C0 单调变化。如 reviewer 追问 \"would 72B+ work?\"，可指出 C0→0 趋势 意味着更大模型会像 QwQ-32B 一样使\n201\t    SICA 退化，而非改善。\n202\t\n203\t    '\n204\t- name: constraint_quality_case_studies\n205\t  plan_id: exp-008\n206\t  description: 5-10 representative questions qualitative analysis\n207\t  expected_results:\n208\t    n_cases: 8\n209\t    syntactically_valid_rate: 0.89\n210\t    semantically_meaningful_rate: 0.62\n211\t    discriminative_constraints_rate: 0.15\n212\t    common_failure_modes:\n213\t      tautological: 0.35\n214\t      overly_general: 0.28\n215\t      contradicts_reasoning: 0.12\n216\t      correct_but_non_discriminative: 0.25\n217\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 constraints 大多语法正确但语义浅薄。~35% 是 tautological（如 \"the\n218\t    answer must be consistent with the premises\"），~28% overly general（如 \"if A then\n219\t    B\" 但 A,B 都被所有 trace 满足）， ~25% correct but non-discriminative（约束正确但所有 candidate\n220\t    answers 都满足）。 仅 ~15% 的 constraints 真正具有 discriminative power，且这些往往也是错误率最高的。 这为\n221\t    F2 scatter 中 constraint precision ≈ 0.50-0.55 提供了定性解释。\n222\t\n223\t    '\n224\t  tables: []\n225\t  figures_description:\n226\t  - 'Table in appendix: 4 representative cases with extracted constraints, ground\n227\t    truth, and failure mode annotation'\n228\t  analysis: 'Case studies 提供 capability trap 的 qualitative evidence。论文中选 2 个 hero\n229\t    cases： (1) high-diversity problem where all constraints are tautological → MAX-SAT\n230\t    = counting; (2) one genuinely discriminative constraint exists but is outweighed\n231\t    by 20+ non-discriminative ones.\n232\t\n233\t    '\n234\t- name: overhead_analysis\n235\t  plan_id: exp-009\n236\t  description: Wall-time breakdown per question from exp-001 data\n237\t  expected_results:\n238\t    n: 804\n239\t    mean_total_wall_s: 62.0\n240\t    mean_trace_gen_s: 32.0\n241\t    trace_gen_pct: 51.6\n242\t    mean_extract_s: 28.5\n243\t    extract_pct: 46.0\n244\t    mean_dedup_s: 1.2\n245\t    dedup_pct: 1.9\n246\t    mean_maxsat_s: 0.003\n247\t    maxsat_pct: 0.005\n248\t    sica_overhead_vs_sc_pct: 48.0\n249\t    sica_overhead_s: 29.7\n250\t    p90_total_s: 105.0\n251\t    p90_overhead_pct: 56.0\n252\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 SICA 额外开销约 48%（constraint extraction ~29s per problem）。\n253\t    MAX-SAT solving 本身极快（<3ms），开销完全来自 LLM-based extraction pass。 这意味着 SICA 近似 double\n254\t    了 SC 的 inference cost，且 gain ≈ 0pp。 对 reviewer \"is the overhead worth it\" 的回答明确是\n255\t    no。\n256\t\n257\t    '\n258\t  tables:\n259\t  - 'T_appendix: overhead breakdown (gen/extract/dedup/maxsat) with percentiles'\n260\t  figures_description:\n261\t  - 'Appendix bar chart: stacked time breakdown per phase'\n262\t  analysis: '论文中报告 \"SICA incurs ~48% overhead over SC, with constraint extraction\n263\t    accounting for 96% of the additional cost. Given zero significant accuracy gain,\n264\t    the overhead is not justified. However, if extraction quality improves (cf. oracle\n265\t    result), the solving overhead (0.005%) would remain negligible.\" 这连接到 oracle 作为\n266\t    constructive direction。\n267\t\n268\t    '\n269\t- name: sica_llama_8b\n270\t  plan_id: exp-011\n271\t  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct on D012 60 questions\n272\t  expected_results:\n273\t    n: 60\n274\t    k: 12\n275\t    sica_accuracy: 0.65\n276\t    sc_accuracy: 0.6\n277\t    delta_pp: 5.0\n278\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.6\n279\t    extraction_rate: 0.86\n280\t    answer_extraction_rate: 0.9\n281\t    contradiction_rate: 0.05\n282\t    mcnemar_p: 0.25\n283\t    discordant_sica_wins: 4\n284\t    discordant_sc_wins: 1\n285\t    truncated_traces: 40\n286\t    proofwriter_delta_pp: 3.3\n287\t    folio_delta_pp: 6.7\n288\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心假设之一：LLaMA-8B D012 出现 +5pp (n=60) 的 underpowered positive\n289\t    signal。 p≈0.25 不显著，SE≈6pp 意味着 CI 包含 0。这是最棘手的条件——reviewer 会问 \"is this a real signal\n290\t    or noise?\" 需要在论文中显式讨论为 underpowered observation，并指出 exp-019/020 (n=200+)  在相同模型不同域上确认\n291\t    null。高 truncation rate (40/720 traces) 引入 extraction noise， 可能是 false positive\n292\t    的来源。\n293\t\n294\t    '\n295\t  tables:\n296\t  - T1 main results LLaMA-8B D012 行 (标注 n=60, suggestive)\n297\t  figures_description:\n298\t  - F4 marker with wide CI error bar\n299\t  analysis: '论文措辞：\"+5.0pp on D012 (n=60, p=0.25) is consistent with sampling noise\n300\t    given the 6pp standard error. LLaMA-8B on StrategyQA (n=200, Δ=+2.0pp, p=0.42)\n301\t    and FOLIO (n=204, Δ=-2.4pp, p=0.27) with adequate power confirm the null.\" 如 reviewer\n302\t    坚持要 powered replication，备选是扩展 D012 到 200 题（~3h GPU）。\n303\t\n304\t    '\n305\t- name: gsm8k_pilot_14b\n306\t  plan_id: exp-012\n307\t  description: Qwen2.5-14B on GSM8K 30-question pilot\n308\t  expected_results:\n309\t    n: 30\n310\t    k: 12\n311\t    sica_accuracy: 0.867\n312\t    sc_accuracy: 0.867\n313\t    delta_pp: 0.0\n314\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.267\n315\t    c0_pct: 26.7\n316\t    extraction_rate: 0.78\n317\t    answer_extraction_rate: 0.95\n318\t    contradiction_rate: 0.03\n319\t    discordant_total: 0\n320\t    constraint_precision: 0.52\n321\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 GSM8K C0 落在 20-35% 范围（这里 26.7%），高于 reviewer 预期的 <20%。\n322\t    14B 在 GSM8K 上 baseline 高 (~87%)，大多数问题 unanimous。C0=26.7% 意味着 ~8/30 问题有 multi-candidate，但这些问题的\n323\t    constraint precision ≈ 0.52（数学 constraints 看似精确但 对 open-answer 域 discriminative\n324\t    power 仍低）。Delta = 0pp 因为 constraints 无法区分 正确与错误的数值答案。这支持 \"C0>20% 但 gain=0\" 的 capability\n325\t    trap narrative。\n326\t\n327\t    '\n328\t  tables:\n329\t  - 'T_appendix: GSM8K pilot results'\n330\t  figures_description:\n331\t  - F4 增加 GSM8K marker (C0≈27%, Δ=0pp)\n332\t  analysis: 'GSM8K 结果的论文价值：(1) 数学域 C0 高于预期，排除 \"C0 high only in restricted-answer domains\"\n333\t    假设； (2) 即使 open-answer + 高 C0，gap 仍= 0，strengthening capability trap。 但 n=30 只能写\n334\t    \"pilot study suggests\"。Reviewer 可能要求扩展。\n335\t\n336\t    '\n337\t- name: constraint_ablation\n338\t  plan_id: exp-013\n339\t  description: MaxSAT vs count-only vs random-weight CPU ablation on exp-001\n340\t  expected_results:\n341\t    maxsat_accuracy: 0.765\n342\t    count_only_accuracy: 0.766\n343\t    random_weight_accuracy: 0.763\n344\t    sc_baseline_accuracy: 0.762\n345\t    n_problems: 804\n346\t    maxsat_vs_count_mcnemar_p: 0.82\n347\t    maxsat_vs_random_mcnemar_p: 0.71\n348\t    agreement_maxsat_count: 802\n349\t    agreement_maxsat_random: 800\n350\t    proxy_based: true\n351\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 MaxSAT≈count-only≈random-weight，三者 agreement >99.5%。\n352\t    这是 capability trap 的 mechanism evidence：MAX-SAT 解算器无贡献，因为 constraints  无 discriminative\n353\t    power 时 satisfiability 退化为 counting。 关键 caveat：ablation 基于 proxy 重构（非原始 z3 公式），reviewer\n354\t    会要求 acknowledge  或做 robustness check。Median 档下这个 limitation 可以通过 \"results are\n355\t    consistent across all three ablation variants\" 来 partially defend。\n356\t\n357\t    '\n358\t  tables:\n359\t  - 'T3: Constraint Ablation table (MaxSAT, count-only, random-weight, SC)'\n360\t  figures_description: []\n361\t  analysis: 'T3 是 paper 的核心 mechanism table。措辞：\"MAX-SAT optimization provides no advantage\n362\t    over simple constraint counting (agreement on 802/804 problems), confirming that\n363\t    satisfiability structure is not leveraged — the solver degenerates to a vote counter.\"\n364\t    必须加 footnote acknowledging proxy-based reconstruction limitation。\n365\t\n366\t    '\n367\t- name: sica_deepseek_r1_llama_8b\n368\t  plan_id: exp-014\n369\t  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-LLaMA-8B on D012 60 questions\n370\t  expected_results:\n371\t    n: 60\n372\t    k: 12\n373\t    sica_accuracy: 0.683\n374\t    sc_accuracy: 0.717\n375\t    delta_pp: -3.33\n376\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.583\n377\t    extraction_rate: 0.84\n378\t    answer_extraction_rate: 0.94\n379\t    truncated_traces: 70\n380\t    contradiction_rate: 0.038\n381\t    mcnemar_p: 0.48\n382\t    discordant_sica_wins: 0\n383\t    discordant_sc_wins: 2\n384\t    c0_pct: 58.3\n385\t    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n386\t    reclassified_as: instruction-scale\n387\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心假设：DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B 表现为 instruction-scale model（C0=58%），\n388\t    而非 full reasoning model（预期 C0<5%）。7B 容量不足以维持 deterministic reasoning chains。 Delta\n389\t    = -3.3pp（SICA 反而更差），因为 high C0 + low quality constraints + 高 truncation  导致 MAX-SAT\n390\t    exclusion 有时排除了正确答案的 traces。这是 capability trap 的极端表现： diversity 最高的条件反而最差。论文中重新分类为\n391\t    instruction-scale 而非 reasoning model。\n392\t\n393\t    '\n394\t  tables:\n395\t  - T1 main results DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B 行\n396\t  figures_description:\n397\t  - 'F4: DeepSeek marker at (C0≈58%, Δ≈-3.3pp) — 最右上象限'\n398\t  analysis: '论文叙事调整：\"distilled reasoning models at 7B scale behave identically to\n399\t    instruction models (C0=58% vs <5% for full QwQ-32B), suggesting that deterministic\n400\t    reasoning requires sufficient model capacity.\" 这消除了 \"second reasoning model\" 数据点，\n401\t    但增加了 instruction-scale 模型覆盖（现在 5 个 instruction-scale models）。\n402\t\n403\t    '\n404\t- name: logic_lm_baseline\n405\t  plan_id: exp-015\n406\t  description: Logic-LM × K + majority vote on FOLIO, CPU-only\n407\t  expected_results:\n408\t    n: 204\n409\t    k: 12\n410\t    logic_lm_k_accuracy: 0.779\n411\t    sc_accuracy: 0.794\n412\t    sica_accuracy: 0.794\n413\t    logic_lm_vs_sc_delta_pp: -1.47\n414\t    logic_lm_fol_parse_success: 0.73\n415\t    logic_lm_single_trace_accuracy: 0.72\n416\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 Logic-LM × K ≈ SC 或略低。Logic-LM 对每条 trace 独立做 FOL verification，\n417\t    then majority vote。单 trace verification accuracy ~72%（受 FOL translation error\n418\t    影响）， K=12 后 majority vote 提升到 ~78%，但仍不及 SC 的 79.4%。 原因：Logic-LM 的 single-trace\n419\t    FOL verification 会误判一些正确 traces 为 invalid， 减少了 effective vote pool。SICA 避免了这个问题因为它做\n420\t    cross-trace aggregation。 但两者都不优于 SC，说明 FOL extraction quality 是共同瓶颈。\n421\t\n422\t    '\n423\t  tables:\n424\t  - 'T_appendix: Logic-LM × K vs SC vs SICA comparison'\n425\t  figures_description: []\n426\t  analysis: '论文中用 1-2 段报告：Logic-LM × K approach provides an alternative to MAX-SAT\n427\t    aggregation but suffers from the same extraction quality bottleneck. Its slightly\n428\t    lower accuracy reflects the additional failure mode of single-trace verification\n429\t    rejecting correct reasoning traces with imperfect FOL translations.\n430\t\n431\t    '\n432\t- name: weighted_sc_baseline\n433\t  plan_id: exp-016\n434\t  description: Weighted SC variants on exp-001 data, CPU-only\n435\t  expected_results:\n436\t    n: 804\n437\t    sc_uniform: 0.762\n438\t    inv_length_weighted: 0.767\n439\t    length_weighted: 0.753\n440\t    constraint_count_weighted: 0.753\n441\t    inv_length_vs_sc_p: 0.45\n442\t    length_vs_sc_p: 0.15\n443\t    constraint_count_vs_sc_p: 0.22\n444\t    all_nonsignificant: true\n445\t    best_weighting: inverse-length\n446\t    best_weighting_gap_pp: 0.5\n447\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下所有 weighting schemes ≈ SC，none significant。Inverse-length\n448\t    略优 (+0.5pp) 因为较短 traces 倾向于更自信的模型输出，但效果微弱。Length-weighted 和 constraint-count weighted  略差，因为较长\n449\t    traces / 更多 constraints 不意味着更准确。 这 eliminates \"weighted SC is a simpler alternative\"\n450\t    concern：如果 weighted SC 也无效， 问题不在 aggregation method 而在 signal quality。\n451\t\n452\t    '\n453\t  tables:\n454\t  - 'T_appendix: Weighted SC variants comparison'\n455\t  figures_description: []\n456\t  analysis: '论文中报告：\"Neither MAX-SAT (SICA) nor simpler weighted voting schemes improve\n457\t    over uniform majority voting, confirming that the bottleneck lies in signal quality\n458\t    rather than aggregation methodology.\" 直接回应 Taubenfeld et al. 2024。\n459\t\n460\t    '\n461\t- name: sica_strategyqa_14b\n462\t  plan_id: exp-017\n463\t  description: Qwen2.5-14B on StrategyQA 60 questions\n464\t  expected_results:\n465\t    n: 60\n466\t    k: 12\n467\t    sica_accuracy: 0.567\n468\t    sc_accuracy: 0.55\n469\t    delta_pp: 1.67\n470\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.1\n471\t    c0_pct: 10.0\n472\t    extraction_rate_trace: 0.71\n473\t    extraction_rate_problem: 1.0\n474\t    mcnemar_p: 0.75\n475\t    bootstrap_p_delta_le_0: 0.18\n476\t    discordant_sica_wins: 2\n477\t    discordant_sc_wins: 1\n478\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 StrategyQA C0 意外地低 (~10%)，因为 binary (Yes/No) 答案空间 +\n479\t    14B 足够强 使大多数问题 unanimous。高 C0 预测（35-50%）未实现是 median 档的特征之一—— 模型在 commonsense 上比预期更一致。低\n480\t    C0 意味着 SICA 几乎无操作空间。 +1.67pp 来自极少数 discordant problems，不显著。 但 trace extraction\n481\t    rate 较低 (71%)，因为 commonsense reasoning chains 不易转化为 FOL。\n482\t\n483\t    '\n484\t  tables:\n485\t  - T1 main results StrategyQA 行 (标注 low C0)\n486\t  figures_description:\n487\t  - 'F3 heatmap: StrategyQA cell at low C0, Δ≈0'\n488\t  analysis: 'StrategyQA 低 C0 意味着它不是 capability trap 的好测试域（C0 太低，SICA 退化为 SC）。 论文中需\n489\t    acknowledge：\"SICA operates meaningfully (C0>20%) primarily on formal logic domains;\n490\t    binary-answer commonsense reasoning produces insufficient diversity for the method\n491\t    to diverge from SC.\"\n492\t\n493\t    '\n494\t- name: sica_arc_challenge_14b\n495\t  plan_id: exp-018\n496\t  description: Qwen2.5-14B on ARC-Challenge 60 questions\n497\t  expected_results:\n498\t    n: 60\n499\t    k: 12\n500\t    sica_accuracy: 0.95\n501\t    sc_accuracy: 0.967\n502\t    delta_pp: -1.67\n503\t    multi_candidate_rate: 0.05\n504\t    c0_pct: 5.0\n505\t    extraction_rate: 1.0\n506\t    contradiction_detected: 3\n507\t    discordant_sica_wins: 0\n508\t    discordant_sc_wins: 1\n509\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 ARC-Challenge C0 极低 (~5%)，因为 14B 在 ARC-Challenge 上\n510\t    baseline ~97% （4-choice 格式 + science knowledge 是 14B 的强项）。几乎所有问题 unanimous。 仅\n511\t    3/60 问题有 multi-candidate，其中 1 个 SICA 选错（constraint 误导）。 Delta = -1.67pp 但完全在噪声内。ARC\n512\t    加入论文主要为 domain diversity，非 capability trap evidence。\n513\t\n514\t    '\n515\t  tables:\n516\t  - T1 main results ARC-Challenge 行\n517\t  figures_description:\n518\t  - 'F3 heatmap: ARC cell at C0≈5%, Δ≈0'\n519\t  analysis: 'ARC-Challenge 和 StrategyQA 一样 C0 太低。论文中作为 \"domain coverage\" 贡献， 但需 acknowledge\n520\t    这些域的 null result 是因为 method degenerates 而非 capability trap。 真正测试 capability trap\n521\t    的域只有 FOLIO 和 ProofWriter（C0>30%）。\n522\t\n523\t    '\n524\t- name: constraint_quality_correlation\n525\t  plan_id: exp-019\n526\t  description: Constraint precision per domain × model, correlation with C0 and gap\n527\t  expected_results:\n528\t    n_conditions_analyzed: 8\n529\t    constraint_precision_overall_mean: 0.527\n530\t    constraint_precision_folio_qwen14b: 0.54\n531\t    constraint_precision_pw_qwen14b: 0.52\n532\t    constraint_precision_folio_llama8b: 0.51\n533\t    constraint_precision_strategyqa_qwen14b: 0.53\n534\t    constraint_precision_folio_mistral7b: 0.5\n535\t    precision_vs_c0_r: 0.12\n536\t    precision_vs_c0_p: 0.78\n537\t    precision_vs_gap_r: 0.35\n538\t    precision_vs_gap_p: 0.39\n539\t    f2_non_discriminative_fraction: 0.78\n540\t    per_problem_precision_sd: 0.18\n541\t    subgroup_high_precision_fraction: 0.15\n542\t    subgroup_high_precision_mean: 0.57\n543\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 constraint precision 全局均值 ~0.527（略高于 0.50 random baseline\n544\t    但不足以 产生 aggregate gains）。跨域 × 模型 variation 很小（0.50-0.54），说明 precision 不依赖于 特定域或模型——是\n545\t    self-extraction 的系统性限制。 Per-problem scatter 有异质性：~78% 问题的 precision 在 0.45-0.55（non-discriminative），\n546\t    ~15% 在 0.55-0.58（部分 discriminative 但不够翻转 aggregation）。 这些 partially discriminative\n547\t    问题集中在 FOLIO 的特定 sub-patterns 上。 precision vs C0 无相关 (r=0.12)，precision vs gap\n548\t    弱正相关 (r=0.35) 但不显著， 意味着 \"constraints 质量是独立瓶颈，不随 diversity 或 domain 变化\"。\n549\t\n550\t    '\n551\t  tables:\n552\t  - 'T_appendix: constraint precision by domain × model matrix'\n553\t  figures_description:\n554\t  - 'F2 (hero figure): per-problem scatter of vote entropy vs constraint exclusion\n555\t    rate, colored by flip outcome (n=307 multi-candidate problems). 78% of problems\n556\t    cluster near precision≈0.50 line. Heterogeneous tail visible but insufficient\n557\t    to shift aggregate.'\n558\t  analysis: 'F2 是 paper 最重要的 figure，但 median 档下需要引导解读。论文中加 annotation arrows 标注 (1)\n559\t    \"non-discriminative cluster\" (78% of problems), (2) \"partially discriminative\n560\t    tail\" (15%), (3) \"rare discriminative outliers\" (7%).  Key sentence: \"While 15%\n561\t    of problems show constraint precision 0.55-0.58, this partial discrimination is\n562\t    insufficient to overcome the 78% majority of non-discriminative problems in aggregate.\n563\t    The oracle experiment confirms that with truly discriminative constraints (gold\n564\t    FOL, precision≈0.95), the same aggregation mechanism achieves +8.82pp.\"'\n565\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"23120887-6c71-42a4-97bc-58275f16ad92","uuid":"aba50351-650e-4bb0-bd10-072c566340c2","timestamp":"2026-05-17T17:28:44.433Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260517T165032/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '核心 null（SICA≈SC）在所有 powered 条件中成立，但 LLaMA-8B D012 (n=60) 出现 underpowered\n  positive signal (+4.5pp, p≈0.22)， reviewer 会追问是否需要 powered replication。GSM8K C0\n  落在 25% 左右（高于预期），但 gap 仍≈0，strengthens \"C0 necessary but insufficient\" claim。F2 scatter\n  有明显异质性：部分 FOLIO 子问题 constraint precision 0.55，但 aggregated 仍 non-discriminative。所有\n  claim 措辞需从 definitive 退到 systematic study。exp-013 ablation 基于 proxy 重构而非原始 z3 公式，reviewer\n  会要求 acknowledge limitation 或 robustness check。Oracle 仅 FOLIO 单域，需写 generalizability\n  limitation paragraph。论文仍 EMNLP competitive，contribution 偏 benchmark+diagnostic。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: sica_k_ablation_14b\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: K=6,8,11,12,16,20 sensitivity on D012 60 questions\n  expected_results:\n    K6_sica: 0.733\n    K6_sc: 0.733\n    K6_gap_pp: 0.0\n    K8_sica: 0.75\n    K8_sc: 0.75\n    K8_gap_pp: 0.0\n    K11_sica: 0.733\n    K11_sc: 0.733\n    K11_gap_pp: 0.0\n    K12_sica: 0.733\n    K12_sc: 0.7\n    K12_gap_pp: 3.3\n    K16_sica: 0.717\n    K16_sc: 0.733\n    K16_gap_pp: -1.7\n    K20_sica: 0.7\n    K20_sc: 0.717\n    K20_gap_pp: -1.7\n    odd_K11_gap: 0.0\n    all_K_significant: false\n    tie_fraction_K12: 0.083\n    tie_fraction_K6: 0.0\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 K=11（奇数 K）gap 精确为 0，确认 SICA 的微小增益完全来自 tiebreak mechanism。\n    偶数 K 出现 tie 概率 ~5-8%，SICA 在 tie 上胜率高（~80%），但 tie 太稀少无法产生 aggregate-level significance。\n    K=12 出现 +3.3pp 是 D012 小样本噪声（n=60, SE≈6pp），exp-001 (n=804) 已经收敛到 +0.3pp。 较大 K (16,20)\n    略微负向，因为更多 traces 降低 tie 频率且 constraint extraction 引入更多噪声。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T_appendix: K ablation table, 6 rows × (K, SICA%, SC%, Δpp, tie_rate, p)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Appendix figure: K vs Δpp line plot with 95% bootstrap CI bands, all CIs cross\n    zero'\n  analysis: 'K=11 gap=0 是 capability trap 的直接证据：奇数 K 无 tie，SICA 退化为 SC。 论文中需写 \"SICA''s\n    occasional marginal advantage at even K is entirely attributable to its superior\n    tiebreak mechanism, not to constraint-based reasoning.\"\n\n    '\n- name: tiebreak_baseline_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: SICA vs SC-random-tiebreak vs SC-deterministic on all data, CPU-only\n  expected_results:\n    n_tied_problems: 41\n    n_total: 804\n    tie_rate: 0.051\n    sica_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.78\n    random_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.49\n    alphabetical_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.56\n    first_seen_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.44\n    sica_overall_vs_random_overall_gap_pp: 0.25\n    sica_overall_vs_random_overall_p: 0.72\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 tie 仅占 ~5% 问题。SICA 在 tied 子集上显著优于 random（~78% vs 49%），\n    但 tied 子集太小（~41/804），所以 overall accuracy 差异仅 ~0.25pp，不显著。 这支持 \"SICA is a better\n    tiebreaker but ties are too rare to matter\" 叙事。 alphabetical 略高于 random 因为 NLI\n    label 排序碰巧与某些 ground truth 相关（FOLIO 的 True/False/Unknown）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T_appendix: Tiebreak comparison table on tied subset (n=41)'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '论文中可用一段 prose 报告：on the 5.1% of problems with ties, SICA resolves 78%\n    correctly vs 49% for random, but this advantage is insufficient to produce significant\n    aggregate gains given the low tie rate.\n\n    '\n- name: sica_7b_scaling\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on D012 60 questions, within-Qwen scaling\n  expected_results:\n    n: 60\n    k: 12\n    sica_accuracy: 0.6\n    sc_accuracy: 0.617\n    delta_pp: -1.67\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.617\n    extraction_rate: 0.82\n    answer_extraction_rate: 0.91\n    contradiction_rate: 0.065\n    mcnemar_p: 0.73\n    constraint_precision_mean: 0.51\n    c0_pct: 61.7\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 7B 比 14B 更弱：baseline accuracy 降至 ~60%，C0 升至 ~62%（更多\n    disagreement 因为 模型更不确定）。高 C0 + 低 constraint quality（precision ~0.51, 接近 random）=\n    capability trap 经典表现。Delta 略负但在噪声范围内。这强化 \"高 diversity 不等于 gain\" 的 claim， 但 n=60\n    只能作为 suggestive evidence。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T1 main results 增加一行 Qwen2.5-7B\n  figures_description:\n  - F4 C0-vs-gap scatter 增加一个 marker (C0≈62%, Δ≈-1.7pp)\n  analysis: '与 14B (C0=38%, Δ=+0.3pp) 形成对比：C0 更高但 gap 仍≈0 甚至略负。 支持 capability trap\n    但 n=60 只能写 \"consistent with\"。如 reviewer 追问 within-family scaling， 可加 72B 数据点形成\n    3-point trend。\n\n    '\n- name: qwq_32b_operating_regime\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: QwQ-32B existing data formatted for Operating Regime Analysis\n  expected_results:\n    qwq_aggregate_c0_effective_pct: 2.8\n    qwq_sica_eq_sc: true\n    aime_c0_pct: 0.0\n    aime_delta_pp: 0.0\n    proofwriter_c0_pct: 5.3\n    proofwriter_delta_pp: -3.3\n    folio_c0_pct: 0.0\n    folio_delta_pp: 0.0\n    total_n: 46\n    qwq_categorization: full reasoning model, C0<5%\n  result_rationale: 'QwQ-32B 作为 full reasoning model 产生高度一致的 reasoning chains，C0 有效值\n    <3%。 这使 SICA 结构性退化为 SC（只有一个 candidate answer 时 MAX-SAT 无法选择不同答案）。 Median 档下 PW\n    出现微弱负信号（-3.3pp）但 n=17 完全在噪声内。 数据支持 C0 threshold diagnostic：C0<5% → SICA 注定无效。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T1 main results QwQ-32B 行 (C0<5%, Δ=0.0pp)\n  - 'F3 operating regime heatmap: QwQ 占据左下角 (low C0, Δ≈0)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F3 heatmap: QwQ-32B data points clustered at C0≈0-5%, Δ≈0'\n  analysis: 'QwQ-32B 证明 full reasoning model 不需要 SICA（已经 internally consistent）。 与\n    DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B (C0=58%) 形成鲜明对比——蒸馏版不保留 deterministic reasoning。 论文中定位为\n    \"reasoning models make SICA redundant; distilled models make it ineffective.\"\n\n    '\n- name: c0_diagnostic_validation\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: C0 vs SICA-SC gap across all models/K values, CPU analysis\n  expected_results:\n    n_conditions: 12\n    c0_range:\n    - 0.0\n    - 62.0\n    gap_range:\n    - -3.3\n    - 3.3\n    pearson_r: 0.08\n    pearson_p: 0.8\n    c0_threshold_5_sensitivity: 1.0\n    c0_threshold_5_specificity: 0.0\n    c0_below_5_all_zero_gap: true\n    c0_above_20_mean_gap_pp: 0.15\n    c0_above_20_gap_sd: 2.8\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 C0 作为 binary diagnostic 有效（C0<5% → gap≡0，sensitivity=1.0），\n    但作为 continuous predictor 无用（r≈0.08，无相关性）。C0>20% 的条件 gap 均值接近 0 且方差大， 说明 diversity\n    是 necessary but not sufficient。这正是 median 档的核心发现： C0 可以判断 \"不可能有效\" 但不能预测 \"会有效\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T_appendix: all conditions × (model, domain, K, n, C0, Δpp, p)'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F4: experiment-level C0 vs Δpp scatter, marker size ∝ sqrt(n), horizontal band\n    at Δ=0, vertical line at C0=5%'\n  analysis: 'Claim 3 措辞调整为 \"C0 is a necessary-but-insufficient condition and a zero-cost\n    early stopping criterion: C0<5% guarantees SICA=SC, but C0>20% does not predict\n    gains.\" r≈0.08 表明 diversity 和 effectiveness 之间没有梯度关系，只有 threshold 关系。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_72b_awq\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct AWQ on D012 60 questions\n  expected_results:\n    n: 60\n    k: 12\n    sica_accuracy: 0.817\n    sc_accuracy: 0.833\n    delta_pp: -1.67\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.217\n    extraction_rate: 0.93\n    answer_extraction_rate: 1.0\n    contradiction_rate: 0.018\n    mcnemar_p: 0.65\n    c0_pct: 21.7\n  result_rationale: '72B 模型 baseline 更高 (~83%)，C0 降至 ~22%（模型更自信，disagreement 更少）。\n    C0 刚好在 20% threshold 边缘，SICA 有极少 multi-candidate 问题可操作，但 constraint quality  仍不足以产生\n    positive gap。Delta 略负（-1.67pp）但在 n=60 噪声内。 Within-Qwen scaling trend: 7B (C0=62%,\n    Δ≈-1.7) → 14B (C0=38%, Δ=+0.3) → 72B (C0=22%, Δ≈-1.7)。 无单调关系，confirming capability\n    trap 不是简单的 scale 问题。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T1 main results 增加 Qwen2.5-72B 行\n  figures_description:\n  - F4 增加 72B marker (C0≈22%, Δ≈-1.7pp, large marker due to Qwen family)\n  analysis: '72B 是 within-family scaling 的关键数据点。C0 随 scale 下降（62%→38%→22%）， 但 gap\n    不随 C0 单调变化。如 reviewer 追问 \"would 72B+ work?\"，可指出 C0→0 趋势 意味着更大模型会像 QwQ-32B 一样使\n    SICA 退化，而非改善。\n\n    '\n- name: constraint_quality_case_studies\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: 5-10 representative questions qualitative analysis\n  expected_results:\n    n_cases: 8\n    syntactically_valid_rate: 0.89\n    semantically_meaningful_rate: 0.62\n    discriminative_constraints_rate: 0.15\n    common_failure_modes:\n      tautological: 0.35\n      overly_general: 0.28\n      contradicts_reasoning: 0.12\n      correct_but_non_discriminative: 0.25\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 constraints 大多语法正确但语义浅薄。~35% 是 tautological（如 \"the\n    answer must be consistent with the premises\"），~28% overly general（如 \"if A then\n    B\" 但 A,B 都被所有 trace 满足）， ~25% correct but non-discriminative（约束正确但所有 candidate\n    answers 都满足）。 仅 ~15% 的 constraints 真正具有 discriminative power，且这些往往也是错误率最高的。 这为\n    F2 scatter 中 constraint precision ≈ 0.50-0.55 提供了定性解释。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Table in appendix: 4 representative cases with extracted constraints, ground\n    truth, and failure mode annotation'\n  analysis: 'Case studies 提供 capability trap 的 qualitative evidence。论文中选 2 个 hero\n    cases： (1) high-diversity problem where all constraints are tautological → MAX-SAT\n    = counting; (2) one genuinely discriminative constraint exists but is outweighed\n    by 20+ non-discriminative ones.\n\n    '\n- name: overhead_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: Wall-time breakdown per question from exp-001 data\n  expected_results:\n    n: 804\n    mean_total_wall_s: 62.0\n    mean_trace_gen_s: 32.0\n    trace_gen_pct: 51.6\n    mean_extract_s: 28.5\n    extract_pct: 46.0\n    mean_dedup_s: 1.2\n    dedup_pct: 1.9\n    mean_maxsat_s: 0.003\n    maxsat_pct: 0.005\n    sica_overhead_vs_sc_pct: 48.0\n    sica_overhead_s: 29.7\n    p90_total_s: 105.0\n    p90_overhead_pct: 56.0\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 SICA 额外开销约 48%（constraint extraction ~29s per problem）。\n    MAX-SAT solving 本身极快（<3ms），开销完全来自 LLM-based extraction pass。 这意味着 SICA 近似 double\n    了 SC 的 inference cost，且 gain ≈ 0pp。 对 reviewer \"is the overhead worth it\" 的回答明确是\n    no。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T_appendix: overhead breakdown (gen/extract/dedup/maxsat) with percentiles'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Appendix bar chart: stacked time breakdown per phase'\n  analysis: '论文中报告 \"SICA incurs ~48% overhead over SC, with constraint extraction\n    accounting for 96% of the additional cost. Given zero significant accuracy gain,\n    the overhead is not justified. However, if extraction quality improves (cf. oracle\n    result), the solving overhead (0.005%) would remain negligible.\" 这连接到 oracle 作为\n    constructive direction。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_llama_8b\n  plan_id: exp-011\n  description: LLaMA-3.1-8B-Instruct on D012 60 questions\n  expected_results:\n    n: 60\n    k: 12\n    sica_accuracy: 0.65\n    sc_accuracy: 0.6\n    delta_pp: 5.0\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.6\n    extraction_rate: 0.86\n    answer_extraction_rate: 0.9\n    contradiction_rate: 0.05\n    mcnemar_p: 0.25\n    discordant_sica_wins: 4\n    discordant_sc_wins: 1\n    truncated_traces: 40\n    proofwriter_delta_pp: 3.3\n    folio_delta_pp: 6.7\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心假设之一：LLaMA-8B D012 出现 +5pp (n=60) 的 underpowered positive\n    signal。 p≈0.25 不显著，SE≈6pp 意味着 CI 包含 0。这是最棘手的条件——reviewer 会问 \"is this a real signal\n    or noise?\" 需要在论文中显式讨论为 underpowered observation，并指出 exp-019/020 (n=200+)  在相同模型不同域上确认\n    null。高 truncation rate (40/720 traces) 引入 extraction noise， 可能是 false positive\n    的来源。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T1 main results LLaMA-8B D012 行 (标注 n=60, suggestive)\n  figures_description:\n  - F4 marker with wide CI error bar\n  analysis: '论文措辞：\"+5.0pp on D012 (n=60, p=0.25) is consistent with sampling noise\n    given the 6pp standard error. LLaMA-8B on StrategyQA (n=200, Δ=+2.0pp, p=0.42)\n    and FOLIO (n=204, Δ=-2.4pp, p=0.27) with adequate power confirm the null.\" 如 reviewer\n    坚持要 powered replication，备选是扩展 D012 到 200 题（~3h GPU）。\n\n    '\n- name: gsm8k_pilot_14b\n  plan_id: exp-012\n  description: Qwen2.5-14B on GSM8K 30-question pilot\n  expected_results:\n    n: 30\n    k: 12\n    sica_accuracy: 0.867\n    sc_accuracy: 0.867\n    delta_pp: 0.0\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.267\n    c0_pct: 26.7\n    extraction_rate: 0.78\n    answer_extraction_rate: 0.95\n    contradiction_rate: 0.03\n    discordant_total: 0\n    constraint_precision: 0.52\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 GSM8K C0 落在 20-35% 范围（这里 26.7%），高于 reviewer 预期的 <20%。\n    14B 在 GSM8K 上 baseline 高 (~87%)，大多数问题 unanimous。C0=26.7% 意味着 ~8/30 问题有 multi-candidate，但这些问题的\n    constraint precision ≈ 0.52（数学 constraints 看似精确但 对 open-answer 域 discriminative\n    power 仍低）。Delta = 0pp 因为 constraints 无法区分 正确与错误的数值答案。这支持 \"C0>20% 但 gain=0\" 的 capability\n    trap narrative。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T_appendix: GSM8K pilot results'\n  figures_description:\n  - F4 增加 GSM8K marker (C0≈27%, Δ=0pp)\n  analysis: 'GSM8K 结果的论文价值：(1) 数学域 C0 高于预期，排除 \"C0 high only in restricted-answer domains\"\n    假设； (2) 即使 open-answer + 高 C0，gap 仍= 0，strengthening capability trap。 但 n=30 只能写\n    \"pilot study suggests\"。Reviewer 可能要求扩展。\n\n    '\n- name: constraint_ablation\n  plan_id: exp-013\n  description: MaxSAT vs count-only vs random-weight CPU ablation on exp-001\n  expected_results:\n    maxsat_accuracy: 0.765\n    count_only_accuracy: 0.766\n    random_weight_accuracy: 0.763\n    sc_baseline_accuracy: 0.762\n    n_problems: 804\n    maxsat_vs_count_mcnemar_p: 0.82\n    maxsat_vs_random_mcnemar_p: 0.71\n    agreement_maxsat_count: 802\n    agreement_maxsat_random: 800\n    proxy_based: true\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 MaxSAT≈count-only≈random-weight，三者 agreement >99.5%。\n    这是 capability trap 的 mechanism evidence：MAX-SAT 解算器无贡献，因为 constraints  无 discriminative\n    power 时 satisfiability 退化为 counting。 关键 caveat：ablation 基于 proxy 重构（非原始 z3 公式），reviewer\n    会要求 acknowledge  或做 robustness check。Median 档下这个 limitation 可以通过 \"results are\n    consistent across all three ablation variants\" 来 partially defend。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T3: Constraint Ablation table (MaxSAT, count-only, random-weight, SC)'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'T3 是 paper 的核心 mechanism table。措辞：\"MAX-SAT optimization provides no advantage\n    over simple constraint counting (agreement on 802/804 problems), confirming that\n    satisfiability structure is not leveraged — the solver degenerates to a vote counter.\"\n    必须加 footnote acknowledging proxy-based reconstruction limitation。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_deepseek_r1_llama_8b\n  plan_id: exp-014\n  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-LLaMA-8B on D012 60 questions\n  expected_results:\n    n: 60\n    k: 12\n    sica_accuracy: 0.683\n    sc_accuracy: 0.717\n    delta_pp: -3.33\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.583\n    extraction_rate: 0.84\n    answer_extraction_rate: 0.94\n    truncated_traces: 70\n    contradiction_rate: 0.038\n    mcnemar_p: 0.48\n    discordant_sica_wins: 0\n    discordant_sc_wins: 2\n    c0_pct: 58.3\n    model: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\n    reclassified_as: instruction-scale\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档核心假设：DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B 表现为 instruction-scale model（C0=58%），\n    而非 full reasoning model（预期 C0<5%）。7B 容量不足以维持 deterministic reasoning chains。 Delta\n    = -3.3pp（SICA 反而更差），因为 high C0 + low quality constraints + 高 truncation  导致 MAX-SAT\n    exclusion 有时排除了正确答案的 traces。这是 capability trap 的极端表现： diversity 最高的条件反而最差。论文中重新分类为\n    instruction-scale 而非 reasoning model。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T1 main results DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B 行\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F4: DeepSeek marker at (C0≈58%, Δ≈-3.3pp) — 最右上象限'\n  analysis: '论文叙事调整：\"distilled reasoning models at 7B scale behave identically to\n    instruction models (C0=58% vs <5% for full QwQ-32B), suggesting that deterministic\n    reasoning requires sufficient model capacity.\" 这消除了 \"second reasoning model\" 数据点，\n    但增加了 instruction-scale 模型覆盖（现在 5 个 instruction-scale models）。\n\n    '\n- name: logic_lm_baseline\n  plan_id: exp-015\n  description: Logic-LM × K + majority vote on FOLIO, CPU-only\n  expected_results:\n    n: 204\n    k: 12\n    logic_lm_k_accuracy: 0.779\n    sc_accuracy: 0.794\n    sica_accuracy: 0.794\n    logic_lm_vs_sc_delta_pp: -1.47\n    logic_lm_fol_parse_success: 0.73\n    logic_lm_single_trace_accuracy: 0.72\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 Logic-LM × K ≈ SC 或略低。Logic-LM 对每条 trace 独立做 FOL verification，\n    then majority vote。单 trace verification accuracy ~72%（受 FOL translation error\n    影响）， K=12 后 majority vote 提升到 ~78%，但仍不及 SC 的 79.4%。 原因：Logic-LM 的 single-trace\n    FOL verification 会误判一些正确 traces 为 invalid， 减少了 effective vote pool。SICA 避免了这个问题因为它做\n    cross-trace aggregation。 但两者都不优于 SC，说明 FOL extraction quality 是共同瓶颈。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T_appendix: Logic-LM × K vs SC vs SICA comparison'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '论文中用 1-2 段报告：Logic-LM × K approach provides an alternative to MAX-SAT\n    aggregation but suffers from the same extraction quality bottleneck. Its slightly\n    lower accuracy reflects the additional failure mode of single-trace verification\n    rejecting correct reasoning traces with imperfect FOL translations.\n\n    '\n- name: weighted_sc_baseline\n  plan_id: exp-016\n  description: Weighted SC variants on exp-001 data, CPU-only\n  expected_results:\n    n: 804\n    sc_uniform: 0.762\n    inv_length_weighted: 0.767\n    length_weighted: 0.753\n    constraint_count_weighted: 0.753\n    inv_length_vs_sc_p: 0.45\n    length_vs_sc_p: 0.15\n    constraint_count_vs_sc_p: 0.22\n    all_nonsignificant: true\n    best_weighting: inverse-length\n    best_weighting_gap_pp: 0.5\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下所有 weighting schemes ≈ SC，none significant。Inverse-length\n    略优 (+0.5pp) 因为较短 traces 倾向于更自信的模型输出，但效果微弱。Length-weighted 和 constraint-count weighted  略差，因为较长\n    traces / 更多 constraints 不意味着更准确。 这 eliminates \"weighted SC is a simpler alternative\"\n    concern：如果 weighted SC 也无效， 问题不在 aggregation method 而在 signal quality。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T_appendix: Weighted SC variants comparison'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '论文中报告：\"Neither MAX-SAT (SICA) nor simpler weighted voting schemes improve\n    over uniform majority voting, confirming that the bottleneck lies in signal quality\n    rather than aggregation methodology.\" 直接回应 Taubenfeld et al. 2024。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_strategyqa_14b\n  plan_id: exp-017\n  description: Qwen2.5-14B on StrategyQA 60 questions\n  expected_results:\n    n: 60\n    k: 12\n    sica_accuracy: 0.567\n    sc_accuracy: 0.55\n    delta_pp: 1.67\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.1\n    c0_pct: 10.0\n    extraction_rate_trace: 0.71\n    extraction_rate_problem: 1.0\n    mcnemar_p: 0.75\n    bootstrap_p_delta_le_0: 0.18\n    discordant_sica_wins: 2\n    discordant_sc_wins: 1\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 StrategyQA C0 意外地低 (~10%)，因为 binary (Yes/No) 答案空间 +\n    14B 足够强 使大多数问题 unanimous。高 C0 预测（35-50%）未实现是 median 档的特征之一—— 模型在 commonsense 上比预期更一致。低\n    C0 意味着 SICA 几乎无操作空间。 +1.67pp 来自极少数 discordant problems，不显著。 但 trace extraction\n    rate 较低 (71%)，因为 commonsense reasoning chains 不易转化为 FOL。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T1 main results StrategyQA 行 (标注 low C0)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F3 heatmap: StrategyQA cell at low C0, Δ≈0'\n  analysis: 'StrategyQA 低 C0 意味着它不是 capability trap 的好测试域（C0 太低，SICA 退化为 SC）。 论文中需\n    acknowledge：\"SICA operates meaningfully (C0>20%) primarily on formal logic domains;\n    binary-answer commonsense reasoning produces insufficient diversity for the method\n    to diverge from SC.\"\n\n    '\n- name: sica_arc_challenge_14b\n  plan_id: exp-018\n  description: Qwen2.5-14B on ARC-Challenge 60 questions\n  expected_results:\n    n: 60\n    k: 12\n    sica_accuracy: 0.95\n    sc_accuracy: 0.967\n    delta_pp: -1.67\n    multi_candidate_rate: 0.05\n    c0_pct: 5.0\n    extraction_rate: 1.0\n    contradiction_detected: 3\n    discordant_sica_wins: 0\n    discordant_sc_wins: 1\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 ARC-Challenge C0 极低 (~5%)，因为 14B 在 ARC-Challenge 上\n    baseline ~97% （4-choice 格式 + science knowledge 是 14B 的强项）。几乎所有问题 unanimous。 仅\n    3/60 问题有 multi-candidate，其中 1 个 SICA 选错（constraint 误导）。 Delta = -1.67pp 但完全在噪声内。ARC\n    加入论文主要为 domain diversity，非 capability trap evidence。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - T1 main results ARC-Challenge 行\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F3 heatmap: ARC cell at C0≈5%, Δ≈0'\n  analysis: 'ARC-Challenge 和 StrategyQA 一样 C0 太低。论文中作为 \"domain coverage\" 贡献， 但需 acknowledge\n    这些域的 null result 是因为 method degenerates 而非 capability trap。 真正测试 capability trap\n    的域只有 FOLIO 和 ProofWriter（C0>30%）。\n\n    '\n- name: constraint_quality_correlation\n  plan_id: exp-019\n  description: Constraint precision per domain × model, correlation with C0 and gap\n  expected_results:\n    n_conditions_analyzed: 8\n    constraint_precision_overall_mean: 0.527\n    constraint_precision_folio_qwen14b: 0.54\n    constraint_precision_pw_qwen14b: 0.52\n    constraint_precision_folio_llama8b: 0.51\n    constraint_precision_strategyqa_qwen14b: 0.53\n    constraint_precision_folio_mistral7b: 0.5\n    precision_vs_c0_r: 0.12\n    precision_vs_c0_p: 0.78\n    precision_vs_gap_r: 0.35\n    precision_vs_gap_p: 0.39\n    f2_non_discriminative_fraction: 0.78\n    per_problem_precision_sd: 0.18\n    subgroup_high_precision_fraction: 0.15\n    subgroup_high_precision_mean: 0.57\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 constraint precision 全局均值 ~0.527（略高于 0.50 random baseline\n    但不足以 产生 aggregate gains）。跨域 × 模型 variation 很小（0.50-0.54），说明 precision 不依赖于 特定域或模型——是\n    self-extraction 的系统性限制。 Per-problem scatter 有异质性：~78% 问题的 precision 在 0.45-0.55（non-discriminative），\n    ~15% 在 0.55-0.58（部分 discriminative 但不够翻转 aggregation）。 这些 partially discriminative\n    问题集中在 FOLIO 的特定 sub-patterns 上。 precision vs C0 无相关 (r=0.12)，precision vs gap\n    弱正相关 (r=0.35) 但不显著， 意味着 \"constraints 质量是独立瓶颈，不随 diversity 或 domain 变化\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - 'T_appendix: constraint precision by domain × model matrix'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'F2 (hero figure): per-problem scatter of vote entropy vs constraint exclusion\n    rate, colored by flip outcome (n=307 multi-candidate problems). 78% of problems\n    cluster near precision≈0.50 line. Heterogeneous tail visible but insufficient\n    to shift aggregate.'\n  analysis: 'F2 是 paper 最重要的 figure，但 median 档下需要引导解读。论文中加 annotation arrows 标注 (1)\n    \"non-discriminative cluster\" (78% of problems), (2) \"partially discriminative\n    tail\" (15%), (3) \"rare discriminative outliers\" (7%).  Key sentence: \"While 15%\n    of problems show constraint precision 0.55-0.58, this partial discrimination is\n    insufficient to overcome the 78% majority of non-discriminative problems in aggregate.\n    The oracle experiment confirms that with truly discriminative constraints (gold\n    FOL, precision≈0.95), the same aggregation mechanism achieves +8.82pp.\"'\n","numLines":565,"startLine":1,"totalLines":565}}}
