{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QFxsfYWmyteU6uPaYWhSoC","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 symb_invariant_consensus 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (41 个)\\n\\n- **exp-011-llama8b**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **exp-016-weighted-sc**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-005**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **sica_constraint_ablation_013**: DONE (success) — \\n- **sica_folio30**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **sica_d016_c0_precheck**: DONE (success) — \\n- **sica_proofwriter30_v2**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **sica_proofwriter30**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **sica_aime30_v3**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **sica_aime30_v2**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **sica_aime30_t07**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp_math50_t07**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **sica_smoke_5q**: DONE (success) — \\n- **smoke-test-5q**: PREPARING (failed) — \\n- **crd_folio_main**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-17\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| exp-004-qwen7b | Within-family scaling: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 在 D012 60 题上 SICA vs SC。弱模型预期 C0 > 14B（更多 diversity），但 constraint quality 预期更低，SICA-SC gap 预期≈0——验证 capability trap 的 scaling 维度。 | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- smoke-test-5q（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **exp-012-gsm8k-pilot** (negative): Cross-domain validation: Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct 在 GSM8K (开放答案数学域) 30 题上 SICA vs SC。预期 C0<20%（14B 在 GSM8K 太强），验证 C0 作为 SICA 无效性预测指标。 ← 基于 sica_expanded_14b\\n- **exp-021-oracle-folio** (success): If we replace self-extracted constraints with gold FOL annotations verified by Z3, Oracle-SICA should significantly outperform both SC and SICA, demonstrating that constraint quality is the bottleneck for SICA gains on formal logic tasks. ← 基于 sica_expanded_14b\\n  [exp021_oracle_folio_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/exp-021-oracle-folio/data/exp021_summary.txt)\\n- **temperature-ablation-t10** (negative): Temperature ablation T=1.0: 高温下 Qwen2.5-14B trace diversity 最大化（C0 预期>60%），SICA-SC gap 预期≈0 或负——验证最大 diversity 仍不能拯救 SICA，因为 constraint discriminative power 不随 diversity 增加 ← 基于 sica_expanded_14b\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 13 / 负向 11 / 失败 9 / 共 39\\nsc_accuracy: 0.7941 ↓（近 3 次 success）\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestd-32608: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n- mvp_math50_t07: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- sica_aime30_t07: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- sica_aime30_v2: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- sica_aime30_v3: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- sica_proofwriter30: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- sica_folio30: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- sica_proofwriter30_v2: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- exp-011-llama8b: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp-010-mistral: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp-011-llama8b-v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp-017-strategyqa: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp-018-arc: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp-010-mistral-v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- exp-017-strategyqa-v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- pilot-contrastive-prompt: 训练失败 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Xn5Ss8t8VvYgHo2ibKiUja","session_id":"23120887-6c71-42a4-97bc-58275f16ad92","uuid":"0904d503-8d9e-4717-8321-03fd485aa38a","timestamp":"2026-05-17T17:30:06.002Z"}
