{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016YQ9pZhr75gvjikL1Ueoem","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tReport path: /root/symb_invariant_consensus/results/exp001_analysis.md\n2\t\n3\tKey metrics:\n4\t- Overall (804): SICA 76.49% vs SC 76.24% (+0.25pp, p=0.7433, 95%CI [-1.12, +1.62])\n5\t- ProofWriter D5 (600): 75.50% vs 75.17% (+0.33pp)\n6\t- FOLIO (204): 79.41% vs 79.41% (0.00pp)\n7\t- Disagreements: 31/804 (3.9%), SICA wins 16, SC wins 14, both wrong 1\n8\t- Tie-break pattern: 20/31 (65%) disagreements are SC ties (e.g. 6:6)\n9\t- Multi-candidate advantage: +0.65pp, unanimous: 0pp\n10\t- Avg unique constraints: 21.5/problem\n11\t- D012 +3.3pp → full-scale +0.25pp = small sample noise confirmed"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01V3hzPemdVd7ny4eAfse2sx","session_id":"23120887-6c71-42a4-97bc-58275f16ad92","uuid":"3e931eb5-0291-448a-8b99-ee2ef9df00f7","timestamp":"2026-05-17T17:30:32.078Z"}
